# Inventory Management and Online Shopping System

## Project Progress and Next Milestone Tasks

### Project Overview

Our team is developing an Inventory Management and Online Shopping System. The project includes a website where customers can browse products and a MySQL database to manage product information, inventory, customers, orders, and sales.

## Completed Work

### Website Development

* Created the initial website using JetBrains tools.
* Developed the main website structure and pages.
* Started organizing the product catalog and shopping features.

### Database Development

* Created the MySQL database.
* Established the initial database structure.
* Organized the data needed for product and inventory management.

